			"notes": "![java 2023-08-16 18-22-20-03](https://github.com/paulevsGitch/BetterWeather/assets/17707380/99d997fa-3952-4f9a-93e6-03e1dff68d97)\n\n**Changes:**\n- Client and common configs (moved into better_weather folder)\n- Optional solid rendering for clouds (vanilla style)\n- Thunderstorms\n- Enhanced rendering for lightnings\n- Lightning rod block tag (default values are iron block and iron door), blocks with this tag will protect area from lightnings\n- Dimension tags: `no_rain`, `no_thunder`, `eternal_rain`, `eternal_thunder`, can control weather for the whole dimension\n- More config options\n- Fixed too small frustum angle\n- Fixed crash on startup when music is disabled"
